{"id": "v5-seed-001-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-01", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "我在暖气片后面找到了你的围巾。我把它放在玄关的长凳上了，没有放进洗衣篮。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-001-zh-CN", "group_id": "v5-seed-01", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "I found your scarf behind the radiator. I have left it on the entryway bench rather than in the laundry basket.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-002-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-02", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "水管工拧紧了接头，但开着水龙头时，管子仍会滴水。请在下面放一个桶。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-002-zh-CN", "group_id": "v5-seed-02", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "The plumber tightened the joint, but the pipe still drips when the tap is running. Please put a bucket underneath it.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-003-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-03", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "下班后我可以去取买好的杂货。把订单号发给我，不要发你的账号密码。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-003-zh-CN", "group_id": "v5-seed-03", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "I can collect the groceries after work. Send me the order number, not the password for your account.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-004-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-04", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "搬家公司会打包书籍，但抽屉里的东西得由我们自己清空。他们不运送散装液体。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-004-zh-CN", "group_id": "v5-seed-04", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "The moving company will pack the books, but we have to empty the drawers ourselves. They will not transport loose liquids.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-005-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-05", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "这条缆索铁路沿山坡向上运行。它是地面缆车，所以车厢沿轨道行驶，不是悬挂在空中的缆绳上。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-005-zh-CN", "group_id": "v5-seed-05", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The cable railway runs up the hillside. It is a funicular, so the carriages stay on rails rather than hanging from an overhead cable.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-006-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-06", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "导游会在庭院里的喷泉旁等候。如果你迟到了，请联系接待处，不要加入别的团队。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-006-zh-CN", "group_id": "v5-seed-06", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The guide will wait beside the fountain in the courtyard. If you arrive late, contact the reception desk instead of joining a different group.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-007-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-07", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "行李寄存柜只收硬币。即使租用时间已经结束，你也需要保留代币才能再次开柜。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-007-zh-CN", "group_id": "v5-seed-07", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "The luggage locker accepts coins only. You need to keep the token to reopen it, even after the rental period has expired.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
{"id": "v5-seed-008-en", "group_id": "v5-seed-08", "category": "travel", "input": {"text": "无障碍入口在建筑后面。正门有几级台阶，没有坡道。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored v5 training seed", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}}
